##########################################################################
# SRS WGS PIPELINE - ILLUMINA
#
# Aim:
#   Analyse Illumina whole-genome sequencing data for structural variants
#   and other variant classes relevant to hereditary optic neuropathies.
#
# Main logic:
#   1. Check BAM quality and coverage.
#   2. Call breakpoint-based SVs with Manta and DELLY.
#   3. Use GRIDSS as independent breakpoint/assembly support.
#   4. Call genome-wide SNVs/indels with DeepVariant.
#   5. Detect read-depth CNVs with CNVpytor and add BAF information.
#   6. Combine breakpoint SVs and read-depth CNVs into one integrated SV VCF.
#   7. Annotate with AnnotSV and VEP.
#   8. Separate known optic-neuropathy genes from non-panel candidates.
#   9. Analyse repeat expansions, mobile elements, mtDNA and MitoCarta context.
#  10. Produce one final table containing the evidence supporting each SV/gene.
#
# IMPORTANT:
#   This workflow is independent from the LRS pipeline.
##########################################################################

